sion using your own figures.</p></div>
<div class='section' id='s18'><div class='section-num'>Section 18</div><h2 class='section-title'>Detection Engineering Pack</h2><div class='callout'><strong>DETECTION CONTENT: NOT INCLUDED IN THIS PUBLIC ARTIFACT.</strong> No detection rule is attached to this report, and none is claimed to be production-ready. Where an Enterprise detection pack exists for this advisory, each rule carries its own validation status &mdash; <em>syntax-checked</em>, <em>offline-tested against fixtures</em>, and <em>validated in a customer environment</em> are separate states, and a rule must be validated in your environment before it is enabled for blocking. Availability is determined per advisory via the <a href='https://intel.cyberdudebivash.com/api/stix/intel--b832d6df1b63bb5d' style='color:var(--accent)'>APEX Enterprise API</a>.</div></div>
<div class='section' id='s19'><div class='section-num'>Section 19</div><h2 class='section-title'>Regulatory Compliance Impact</h2><p><strong>APPLICABILITY: UNKNOWN.</strong> Regulatory obligations arise from a confirmed incident and depend on your organisation, jurisdiction, sector and the data involved. No obligation is established by this advisory. The frameworks below are <em>potentially relevant</em> only; legal review is required before concluding that any applies.</p><div class='reg-matrix'><div class='reg-card' style=''><div class='reg-name'>GDPR&nbsp;<span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:8px'>&#x25CF; POTENTIALLY RELEVANT (UNCONFIRMED)</span></div><div class='reg-trigger'>Conditional - relevant only if personal data is confirmed affected</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; If applicable: 72-hour notification to supervisory authority</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: Up to €20M or 4% global turnover</div></div><div class='reg-card' style=''><div class='reg-name'>DPDP ACT (India)&nbsp;<span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:8px'>&#x25CF; POTENTIALLY RELEVANT (UNCONFIRMED)</span></div><div class='reg-trigger'>Conditional - relevant only if digital personal data of Indian residents is confirmed affected</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; If applicable: notification timelines per DPDP rules</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: Up to ₹250 crore (~$30M)</div></div><div class='reg-card' style='opacity:.55;'><div class='reg-name'>HIPAA</div><div class='reg-trigger'>PHI breach - 500+ records triggers HHS notification</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; 60 days post-discovery; media notification if 500+ in state</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: Up to $1.9M per violation category per year</div></div><div class='reg-card' style='opacity:.55;'><div class='reg-name'>PCI-DSS v4</div><div class='reg-trigger'>Cardholder data environment (CDE) in scope</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; Immediate card scheme notification; forensic investigation mandatory</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: $5K - $100K/month until compliant; card acceptance revocation</div></div><div class='reg-card' style=''><div class='reg-name'>NIS2 (EU)&nbsp;<span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:8px'>&#x25CF; POTENTIALLY RELEVANT (UNCONFIRMED)</span></div><div class='reg-trigger'>Conditional - relevant only to in-scope entities with a confirmed significant incident</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; If applicable: early warning 24h; notification 72h; final report 1 month</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: Essential entities: up to €10M or 2% global turnover</div></div><div class='reg-card' style='opacity:.55;'><div class='reg-name'>SEC Cybersecurity Rules</div><div class='reg-trigger'>Material incident - publicly traded entities</div><div class='reg-deadline'>&#x23F1; Form 8-K filing within 4 business days of materiality determination</div><div class='reg-penalty'>&#x26A0; Statutory maximum, if applicable: Enforcement action; restatement risk</div></div></div></div>
<div class='section' id='s20'><div class='section-num'>Section 20</div><h2 class='section-title'>Business Impact Score &amp; MITRE Navigator Layer</h2><h3>Business Impact Score (BIS)</h3><p>BIS is an APEX-internal weighted heuristic combining CVSS, EPSS, CISA KEV status, indicator count and technique count. It is not a calibrated FAIR loss estimate and is withheld when CVSS, EPSS and KEV data are all unavailable.</p><div class='bis-ring'><div class='bis-circle' style='border-color:var(--muted);background:rgba(0,0,0,.3)'><span class='bis-num' style='color:var(--muted)'>N/A</span><span class='bis-label'>/10 BIS</span></div><div><div style='font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px'>INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE</div><div class='kv' style='grid-template-columns:160px 1fr;font-size:12px'><div class='kv-key'>APEX Risk Input</div><div class='kv-val'>7.0/10</div><div class='kv-key'>CVSS</div><div class='kv-val'>N/A</div><div class='kv-key'>EPSS (30d %)</div><div class='kv-val'>N/A</div><div class='kv-key'>KEV Status</div><div class='kv-val'>Not listed</div><div class='kv-key'>IOC Observables / Validated</div><div class='kv-val'>1 / 0</div><div class='kv-key'>TTP Coverage</div><div class='kv-val'>1 techniques</div></div></div></div><h3 style='margin-top:24px'>MITRE ATT&amp;CK Navigator Layer</h3><p>Download the pre-built Navigator layer to overlay this advisory's techniques onto your existing detection coverage matrix. Identifies gaps and maps directly into ATT&amp;CK Workbench.</p><a class='nav-download' href='data:application/json;charset=utf-8,%7B%22name%22%3A%22APEX%20-%20%5BOpenPhish%5D%20Phishing%20URL%3A%20https%3A//mietenhambugrform.my/%22%2C%22versions%22%3A%7B%22attack%22%3A%2219%22%2C%22navigator%22%3A%224.9%22%2C%22layer%22%3A%224.5%22%7D%2C%22domain%22%3A%22enterprise-attack%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22CYBERDUDEBIVASH%20SENTINEL%20APEX%20v201.0%20-%20%5BOpenPhish%5D%20Phishing%20URL%3A%20https%3A//mietenhambugrform.my/%22%2C%22techniques%22%3A%5B%7B%22techniqueID%22%3A%22T1566%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ff3b3b%22%2C%22comment%22%3A%22Analyst%20inference%20%28APEX%29%20from%20advisory%20text%3A%20%5BOpenPhish%5D%20Phishing%20URL%3A%20https%3A//mietenhambugrform.my/%22%2C%22enabled%22%3Atrue%7D%5D%2C%22gradient%22%3A%7B%22colors%22%3A%5B%22%23ffffff%22%2C%22%23ff3b3b%22%5D%2C%22minValue%22%3A0%2C%22maxValue%22%3A1%7D%2C%22legendItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22label%22%3A%22APEX%20inferred%20technique%20%28not%20observed%29%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ff3b3b%22%7D%5D%2C%22metadata%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22apex_id%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22intel--b832d6df1b63bb5d%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22risk%22%2C%22value%22%3A%227.0%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22attack_release%22%2C%22value%22%3A%2219.2%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22attack_dataset_sha256%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22f7eaf37fe53b50404084fe1fe67237278f7317e61c11ad550295722d13ede259%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22technique_basis%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22ANALYST_INFERENCE%22%7D%5D%7D' download='APEX_intel--b832d6df1_navigator.json'>⬇ Download Navigator Layer (.json)</a><div class='callout' style='margin-top:16px'><strong>Use of BIS:</strong> an APEX-internal prioritisation aid only. Do not cite it in insurance or regulatory disclosures as a loss estimate; combine it with your own asset and exposure data.</div></div>
